@prefix pub: <https://w3id.org/fossr/onto/publications/> .
@prefix vocab: <https://w3id.org/fossr/vocab/> .
@prefix cunarea: <https://w3id.org/fossr/vocab/it-cun-areas/> .
@prefix ad2015: <https://w3id.org/fossr/vocab/it-academic-disciplines-2015/> .
@prefix ad2024: <https://w3id.org/fossr/vocab/it-academic-disciplines-2024/> .
@prefix issuer: <https://w3id.org/fossr/data/issuer/> .
@prefix ad: <https://w3id.org/italia/controlled-vocabulary/classifications-for-universities/academic-disciplines/> .
